d-type="pmid">16187355</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><sec sec-type="display-objects"><title>Figures and Tables</title><fig id="F1" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Screen shot of DASSD showing the dihedral angles distribution and the STRIDE secondary structure classifications for the            amino acid fragment GLU-ALA-LEU</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="97320630001078F1"/></fig></sec><fn-group><fn id="FN1" fn-type="other"><p>      <bold>Citation:</bold>Dayalan      <italic>et al.</italic>, Bioinformation 1(3): 78-80, (2006)</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>